x-cite-author\">Sosip.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.37</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπί σου θαυμάζω, πῶς δύνῃ.. </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.5.12</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θαυμάσονται ἐπ' αὐτῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Le.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26.32</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">6</span> freq. folld. by an interrog. sentence, <span class=\"gk\">θαυμάζομεν οἷον ἐτύχθη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.320</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θ. ὅστις ἔσται ὁ ἀντερῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.38</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θαυμάζοντες τί ἔσοιτο ἡ πολιτεία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3.17</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θ. ὡς οὔπω πάρεισιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.90</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4.20</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">θ. ὅτι</span> I <b class=\"lex-tr\">wonder at the fact that.. </b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">489a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πολλάκις τεθαύμακα ὅπως.. </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Com.Adesp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.46D.</span> </span>; but more commonly, <span class=\"gk\">θ. εἰ.. </span> I <b class=\"le